#: includes/abilities.php:727
msgid "Get animation effects"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:728
msgid "Lists the animation modes and every effect (what it looks like, where it can be used, its directions and options), the easings, the JSON Schema of an animation recipe, and examples. Read this first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:744
msgid "Get a post's animations"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:745
msgid "Lists every block of a post, page, template or pattern with its path, type, a text excerpt, whether it can be animated, and its animation as a recipe (null when it has none). A block whose saved animation set-animations would refuse as it stands has a warnings list saying why. Use the paths and modified_gmt with set-animations. disabled_devices lists the devices this page has animations turned off for."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:763
msgid "Validate an animation recipe"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:764
msgid "Checks a recipe without changing anything. Returns each problem with its path and a fix hint, and the block attributes it would write. Pass block_name for the block-specific rules (image-only effects, stagger)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:792
msgid "Set animations on a post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:793
msgid "Sets or removes the animation of one or more blocks of a post, page, template or pattern, and saves it straight away (also when published). All changes are validated first; if any is invalid nothing is saved and every problem is reported. Where revisions are on, the result names previous_revision_id, the revision to restore to undo it. Each change names the block_name get-animations reported at that path; also pass the modified_gmt it returned, so the change is refused if the post was saved since. Refused while the post is open in the post editor (an open Site Editor is not detected). The result lists disabled_devices: the devices this page has animations turned off for."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:844
msgid "List saved animations"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:845
msgid "Lists the animations the theme ships and, for a user who can manage site settings, the site's saved animation library, each as a recipe ready for set-animations."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:863
msgid "Save an animation to the library"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities.php:864
msgid "Adds a recipe to the site's saved animation library under a name, so editors can apply it from the Motion Effects panel. Needs a user who can manage site settings."
msgstr ""

